1
00:00:00,235 --> 00:00:02,965
(Leonard:)- Hey.
- What?

2
00:00:03,138 --> 00:00:04,728
(Howard:)Nothing.

3
00:00:07,409 --> 00:00:09,739
(Sheldon:)Smart, we don't want any problems.

4
00:00:12,080 --> 00:00:14,410
(Amy:)I can't believe I ditched work
for Disneyland.

5
00:00:14,583 --> 00:00:15,913
(Bernadette:)What did you tell your boss?

6
00:00:16,084 --> 00:00:18,174
(Amy:)Oh, I was very clever, I did it in stages.

7
00:00:18,353 --> 00:00:20,983
At 7 last night I called
about a problem at the lab...

8
00:00:21,156 --> 00:00:23,986
(Amy:)...and casually mentioned
I was going out for seafood.

9
00:00:24,826 --> 00:00:28,856
At 9:30, I called and told him
that one of my scallops tasted weird.

10
00:00:29,030 --> 00:00:32,590
At 11:30, I called and said
I was throwing up like a fire hose.

11
00:00:33,935 --> 00:00:38,265
At 12:45, I called and made nothing
but dry-heaving sounds.

12
00:00:38,607 --> 00:00:40,767
And now I'm going to Disneyland!

13
00:00:42,477 --> 00:00:43,967
(Bernadette:)Penny, what did you say?

14
00:00:44,145 --> 00:00:47,445
(Penny:)I work at the Cheesecake Factory.
I said, "Bye."

15
00:00:49,618 --> 00:00:51,108
(Amy:)So, what are we gonna do first?

16
00:00:51,286 --> 00:00:55,656
I don't know about you, but I'm going to the
place that gives you a princess makeover.

